[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Move the integrated service control unit slightly.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections (3a, 3b, 3c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Integrated services control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236885\">M40A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Integrated services control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236891\">M40B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3c</p></td><td><p>Integrated services control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236898\">M40C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018617.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the control unit\nis undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Refit the integrated service control unit.</p><p>Tighten the screws.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p><p>Check that systems controlled by the control\nunit are working properly.</p>"]]